Z||000002||Monkeyman||06-19-2000||10:54 AM||||The Rustangs have/had a hatch so they actually had something for the second wing to conform to.  Also, they were/are alot taller between the belt line and the roof.  I don't think it would look good on a Fiero.  However...You might consider this.  What about a small tinted plexiglass piece coming out from the top of the rear of the roof?  (OK.  That didn't make any sense.  Picture an older Supra with the Celica body style or one of the last generation MR2s.)  As long as it wasn't too wide (front to rear) (maybe a couple of inches?), I think it would look good.||||reg||1
Z||000003||BAM-BAM||06-19-2000||12:53 PM||||    Phillip, As you kknow, I put a spoiler from a 2000GT Mustang on my 85GT. It looks awesome, has a great profile and will accomidate one of TOM's scoops when the time comes. The only fall back is that they don't use any gaskets on the Mustang. So I am working on creating a gasket seal. The inside edge is slightly lifted on the Fiero deck so it will need some contour. I am planning on posting some pics as soon as the film gets developed. If it is liked by others, I will post a detailed discription of the layout process. It's not that difficult. I even have a source for the spoilers if anyone wants one. Be good <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR>||||reg||6
Z||000004||phillip||06-20-2000||02:47 AM||||i understood monkeyman, but thats not possible for me since i have an indy hood scoop. i was looking at it wondering what a wing that was part of the scoop would look like. some thing not too wide or no wider than the roof top.<P>bam, i had mentioned my mustang wing before. one consideration ( beside the fact that it would be pretty much total overkill and might destroy my scoop. i'm no fiberglass expert.) is that the top wing would have to kind of compliment or have a similar shape to the bottom wing (mustang saleen).<P>as i said, it's one of those weird ideas that pop in my head but i may try if i find a wing that looks adaptable and i think i can mold in. ||||reg||1
